      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "1. Standardized Repositories\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 boilerplate-repo\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 microservices/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 <service-name>-service\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .gitlab-ci.yml\n\u2502       include: central-ci\n\u2502       variables: SERVICE_NAME\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 ... (20+ services)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": "box_repos",
      "originalText": "1. Standardized Repositories\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 boilerplate-repo\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 microservices/\n\u251c\u2500\u2500 <service-name>-service\n\u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 .gitlab-ci.yml\n\u2502       include: central-ci\n\u2502       variables: SERVICE_NAME\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 ... (20+ services)"
