      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "2. Config & Secrets\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 deployment/<env>/variables.json\n(Key-value non-sensitive config)\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 deployment/<env>/secrets.json\n(Keys only, values fetched from SOPS)\n\nPipeline parses both into YAML\nto create the ECS Task Definition.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": "box_central_sops",
      "originalText": "2. Config & Secrets\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 deployment/<env>/variables.json\n(Key-value non-sensitive config)\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 deployment/<env>/secrets.json\n(Keys only, values fetched from SOPS)\n\nPipeline parses both into YAML\nto create the ECS Task Definition."
    },
