      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "3. CI Pipeline (Centralized)\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 central-ci-template\nContains reusable jobs for backend/frontend.\n\n\u2605 Build Once\nPipeline builds the Docker image and pushes\nto the shared AWS ECR registry with a unique\nSHA tag.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": "box_ecr",
      "originalText": "3. CI Pipeline (Centralized)\n\n\ud83d\udcc1 central-ci-template\nContains reusable jobs for backend/frontend.\n\n\u2605 Build Once\nPipeline builds the Docker image and pushes\nto the shared AWS ECR registry with a unique\nSHA tag."
    },
