      "text": "4. DEV Deployment\n\n\u2022 DEV Env:\n  Fast auto-deploy for developers.\n  Task Definition updated and deployed to ECS.\n\n\u2022 UAT, Staging, Prod:\n  More complex, but fully self-service.\n  Dev team deploys without DevOps support!",
